{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-10","kind":"proposition","title":"两个圆至多相交于两点","englishTitle":"A circle does not cut a circle at more points than two.","book":3,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","contentId":"euclid-3-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"718361e55d89f197ba4feb0e53b8488221c1458ce6d6e7987d8078f64023bec8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-10.statement","euclid-3-10.proof.1","euclid-3-10.construction.1","euclid-3-10.proof.2","euclid-3-10.proof.3","euclid-3-10.proof.4","euclid-3-10.proof.5","euclid-3-10.conclusion","euclid-3-10.historical.1","euclid-3-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ab3c7fd9ab2b33810763325210cba9ef493a60461562526947182325fca151e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A circle does not cut a circle at more points than two."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一个圆在两个以上点上不切除一个圆。（相关点与线段：A）"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两圜相交止于两点"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个圆的交点在两个点结束"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8caab7fd50f4c882d8655d01e714e2b5a07148ef6aabdc1b7bb8affe2a614e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let the circle ABC cut the circle DEF at more points than two, namely B, C, F, H;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,让ABC圆将DEF圆的圆圈切开,分数超过两个点,即B、C、F、H;"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f7c3fd1ba9af7f1b7b48cc78ff60f0d296cfa11eb02dd586dd8c8f49283e530","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"let BH, BG be joined and bisected at the points K, L, and from K, L let KC, LM be drawn at right angles to BH, BG and carried through to the points A, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BH,BG在K,L点连接和分解,BH,KC,KC,LM在直角至BH,BG之间绘制,然后通过A,E点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ecf9eea17819a99bb0bda2181dd0652290e62977aacf61fe11b7795a491e33ae","citations":["euclid-3-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since in the circle ABC a straight line AC cuts a straight line BH into two equal parts and at right angles, the centre of the circle ABC is on AC. [[III. 1, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,在ABC圆中,直线AC将直线BH分成两个相等的部分,直角时,圆ABC的中心在AC上。 [[III. 1, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"953ab29eadff6247ebd1cfb34be3bdc71780b1c2257e55b1083bdcc8be7a9301","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since in the same circle ABC a straight line NO cuts a straight line BG into two equal parts and at right angles, the centre of the circle ABC is on NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于在同一圆圈中,ABC直线NO直线将BG直线分成两个相等的部分,直角时,ABC圈的中心位于NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f20f97aec9fb7917c3680911be64e88303f73d14226e50d74db7ac87fcfd0e9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved to be on AC, and the straight lines AC, NO meet at no point except at P; therefore the point P is the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,它也位于AC,AC、NO直线除P外,没有一点相交;因此,P点是ABC圆的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd7017943873a287d5332e0d6331e919437a02f621a211a5188d4e09fec456d5","citations":["euclid-3-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that P is also the centre of the circle DEF; therefore the two circles ABC, DEF which cut one another have the same centre P: which is impossible. [[III. 5](/principles/euclid-3-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,P圆圈也是DEF圆圈的中心;因此,相互切开的两圈ABC、DEF圆圈有相同的P圆圈:这是不可能做到的。 [[III. 5](/principles/euclid-3-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ae3d27525ba8247ac1a90c0c51300291cd9e383b63ea8ba852058025c75d6c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两圜相交止于两点论曰若言甲乙丙丁戊己圜与甲庚乙丁辛戊圜三相交于甲于乙于丁令作甲乙乙丁两直线相联此两线各两平分于壬于癸次从壬癸作子壬子癸两垂线其子壬分甲乙子癸分乙丁既皆两平分而各为两直角即子壬子癸两线俱为甲庚乙丁辛戊圜之函心线〈本篇一之系〉而子为其心矣依显甲乙丙丁戊己圜亦以子为心也夫两交之圜尚不得同心〈本篇五〉何缘得有三交又论曰若言两圜三相交于甲于乙于丁令先寻甲庚乙丁辛戊圜之心于壬〈本篇一〉次从心至三交界作壬甲壬乙壬丁三线此三线等也〈一卷界说十五〉又甲乙丙丁戊己圜内有从壬出之壬甲壬乙壬丁三相等线则壬又为甲乙丙丁戊己圜之心〈本篇九〉不亦交圜同心乎〈本篇五〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两圆相交止于两点证明如下：若言甲乙丙丁戊己圆与甲庚乙丁辛戊圆三相交于甲于乙于丁令作甲乙乙丁两直线相联此两线各平分于壬于癸次从壬癸作子壬子癸两垂线其子壬分甲乙子癸分乙丁既皆平分而各为两直角即子壬子癸两线都为甲庚乙丁辛戊圆之包含圆心线〈本篇一之系〉而子为其心矣依显甲乙丙丁戊己圆亦以子为心也夫两交之圆尚不得同心〈本篇五〉何缘得有三交又证明如下：若言两圆三相交于甲于乙于丁令先寻甲庚乙丁辛戊圆之心于壬〈本篇一〉次从心至三交界作壬甲壬乙壬丁三线此三线等也〈一卷界说十五〉又甲乙丙丁戊己圆内有从壬出之壬甲壬乙壬丁三相等线则壬又为甲乙丙丁戊己圆之心〈本篇九〉不亦交圆同心乎〈本篇五〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-10.source","contentId":"euclid-3-10","revisionId":"euclid-3-10@raw-718361e55d89f197","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a61f97951f3e84035e4d6256f105ae2af207d8a9fcdb145c9b84690c91cc32d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-10:euclid-3-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-10.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"III. 1, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-10:euclid-3-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-10.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"III. 5"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-24:euclid-3-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"III. 10"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-10:euclid-3-1:explicit","id":"euclid-3-1","book":3,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"寻找给定圆的圆心","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-10:euclid-3-5:explicit","id":"euclid-3-5","book":3,"number":5,"kind":"proposition","title":"两圆相交必不同心","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-24:euclid-3-10:explicit","id":"euclid-3-24","book":3,"number":24,"kind":"proposition","title":"相等两直线上作相似两圆分必等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
